{"strongs": "H3075", "word": "יְהוֺזָבָד", "translit": "ye.ho.za.vad", "root": "יה", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "hath beetowed", "definition": "יְהוֺזָבָד , יוֺזָבָד proper name, masculine ᵐ5 usually Ἰωζαβαδ ( ׳ י hath beetowed ; compare Palmyrene נבוזבד Vog 73 ; see also זְבַדְיָהוּ , זַבְדִּיאֵל ) — 1. יְהוֺזָבָד servant & murderer of Joash of Judah 2Kgs 12:22 ( ᵐ5 Ἰεζεβουθ ) = 2Chr 24:26 ( ᵐ5 Ζωζαβεδ , Ἰωζαβεδ , Ἰωζαβεθ ). 2. יוֺזָבָד three of David's mighty men, \\ \\ a. 1Chr 12:5 \\ \\ b. v. 1Chr 12:21 \\ \\ c. v. 1Chr 12:21 ( ᵐ5 Ἰωζαβειθ , Ἰωζαβειδ ). 3. יְהוֺזָבָד a Benjamite chief 2Chr 17:18 . 4. priests & Levites, \\ \\ a. יְהוֺזָבָד 1Chr 26:4 \\ \\ b. יוֺזָבָד 2Chr 31:13 ( ᵐ5 Ἐζαβαθ , Ἰωαζαβαθ ; ᵐ5 L Ἰωαζαβαδ ); \\ \\ c. 2Chr 35:9 ( ᵐ5 Ἰωζαβαδ ; ᵐ5 L as foregoing); \\ \\ d. Ezra 8:33 \\ \\ e. Ezra 10:22 feminine Ezra 10:23 \\ \\ g. Neh 8:7 \\ \\ h. Neh 11:16 ( d. f. g. & \\ \\ h. perhaps the same man).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2105')\">BDB2105</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3075')\">H3075</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H3107')\">H3107</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2104')\">BDB2104</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2106')\">BDB2106</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>יְהוֺזָבָד</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>יוֺזָבָד</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> usually <grk>Ἰωζαβαδ</grk> (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <highlight>hath beetowed</highlight>; compare Palmyrene <bdbheb>נבוזבד</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vog')\">Vog<sup>73</sup></lookup>; see also  <bdbheb><reflink>זְבַדְיָהוּ</reflink></bdbheb>, <bdbheb>זַבְדִּיאֵל</bdbheb>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <bdbheb>יְהוֺזָבָד</bdbheb> servant &amp; murderer of Joash of Judah <ref ref=\"2Kgs 12:22\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(12,12,22)\">2Kgs 12:22</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ἰεζεβουθ</grk>) = <ref ref=\"2Chr 24:26\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(14,24,26)\">2Chr 24:26</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ζωζαβεδ</grk>, <grk>Ἰωζαβεδ</grk>, <grk>Ἰωζαβεθ</grk>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <bdbheb>יוֺזָבָד</bdbheb> three of David's mighty men, <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 12:5\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,5)\">1Chr 12:5</ref> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> v.<ref ref=\"1Chr 12:21\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,21)\">1Chr 12:21</ref> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> v.<ref ref=\"1Chr 12:21\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,21)\">1Chr 12:21</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ἰωζαβειθ</grk>, <grk>Ἰωζαβειδ</grk>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <bdbheb>יְהוֺזָבָד</bdbheb> a Benjamite chief <ref ref=\"2Chr 17:18\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(14,17,18)\">2Chr 17:18</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> priests &amp; Levites, <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <bdbheb>יְהוֺזָבָד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 26:4\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(13,26,4)\">1Chr 26:4</ref> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <bdbheb>יוֺזָבָד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 31:13\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(14,31,13)\">2Chr 31:13</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ἐζαβαθ</grk>, <grk>Ἰωαζαβαθ</grk>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><reflink><sup>L</sup></reflink></lookup> <grk>Ἰωαζαβαδ</grk>); <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <ref ref=\"2Chr 35:9\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(14,35,9)\">2Chr 35:9</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ἰωζαβαδ</grk>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><reflink><sup>L</sup></reflink></lookup> as foregoing); <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <ref ref=\"Ezra 8:33\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(15,8,33)\">Ezra 8:33</ref> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:22\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,22)\">Ezra 10:22</ref> <b>feminine</b> <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:23\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,23)\">Ezra 10:23</ref> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>g.</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 8:7\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(16,8,7)\">Neh 8:7</ref> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>h.</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 11:16\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(16,11,16)\">Neh 11:16</ref> (<b>d. f. g.</b> &amp;<br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>h.</b> perhaps the same man). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "2Kgs 12:22", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 12, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "2Chr 24:26", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 24, "verse": 26}, {"raw": "1Chr 12:5", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 12, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "1Chr 12:21", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 12, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "2Chr 17:18", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 17, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "1Chr 26:4", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 26, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "2Chr 31:13", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 31, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "2Chr 35:9", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 35, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Ezra 8:33", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 8, "verse": 33}, {"raw": "Ezra 10:22", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 10, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Ezra 10:23", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 10, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "Neh 8:7", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 8, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Neh 11